query.description:
a query object to search/filter according to the properites of the stac-item
```
"query": {
   "cloudcover": {
       "gt": 0,
       "lt": 10
   },
   "bands": {
       "eq": [
           "RGB",
           "B001",
           "B002"
       ]
   }
  }
 ```

sort_by.description:
a sortby object to sort the items by the properties of the stac-item
"sortby": [
{
    "field": "properties->>'datetime'",
    "direction": "desc"
}
]

